    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3231630/extras/70cf61ce5df5fdf9992975f0837d9d2e.avif?t=1755276302\" width=616 height=80 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Yuki Sakurano is on a winning streak as an illegal fighter in underground arenas. One day, the legendary fighter named King comes into her life to scout her as a fighter. Little did Yuki know that this event would drastically change her life in very different ways than she was expecting.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3231630/extras/23e5b5392f37f072d0ad6befb10508f2.avif?t=1755276302\" width=616 height=80 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Princess Burst is an interactive game that relies on QTE (Quick Time Events) for its battles. Collect points from your match, and use them to upgrade Yuki\u2019s stats and unlock skills that will help her on her road to ultimate victory!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3231630/extras/5c01b9daaac4e47fc36348828ac49671.avif?t=1755276302\" width=616 height=80 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3231630/extras/1c688769af56c71a2c4f343cd875f588.avif?t=1755276302\" width=616 height=720 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3231630/extras/660d30aab0e8a2a56a145c188a1f8fd0.avif?t=1755276302\" width=616 height=720 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3231630/extras/111ea3da6c5f9ddf51c22fc0ffb8ad36.avif?t=1755276302\" width=616 height=80 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i>Choice Matters</i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >During the gameplay, there will be moments where decisions have to be made. This will both affect the story as you play, as well as determines which of the different endings you will ultimately achieve. Try your best to achieve the best possible ending for Yuki, or see what other fates might lay in store for her, the choice is yours!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i>Progression</i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fighting in matches will unlock points. These can be used to upgrade Yuki\u2019s stats and to unlock new skills that she can use in combat.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i>Free Battle</i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once the story has been completed Free Battle Mode will be unlocked where Yuki can keep testing her mettle in endless battles!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i>Achievements</i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game has its own achievements in the form of Titles. These Titles can be unlocked by reaching certain points in the story, or achieving certain milestones in the game.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3231630/extras/70cf61ce5df5fdf9992975f0837d9d2e.avif?t=1755276302\" width=616 height=80 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Yuki Sakurano is on a winning streak as an illegal fighter in underground arenas. One day, the legendary fighter named King comes into her life to scout her as a fighter. Little did Yuki know that this event would drastically change her life in very different ways than she was expecting.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3231630/extras/23e5b5392f37f072d0ad6befb10508f2.avif?t=1755276302\" width=616 height=80 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Princess Burst is an interactive game that relies on QTE (Quick Time Events) for its battles. Collect points from your match, and use them to upgrade Yuki\u2019s stats and unlock skills that will help her on her road to ultimate victory!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3231630/extras/5c01b9daaac4e47fc36348828ac49671.avif?t=1755276302\" width=616 height=80 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3231630/extras/1c688769af56c71a2c4f343cd875f588.avif?t=1755276302\" width=616 height=720 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3231630/extras/660d30aab0e8a2a56a145c188a1f8fd0.avif?t=1755276302\" width=616 height=720 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3231630/extras/111ea3da6c5f9ddf51c22fc0ffb8ad36.avif?t=1755276302\" width=616 height=80 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i>Choice Matters</i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >During the gameplay, there will be moments where decisions have to be made. This will both affect the story as you play, as well as determines which of the different endings you will ultimately achieve. Try your best to achieve the best possible ending for Yuki, or see what other fates might lay in store for her, the choice is yours!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i>Progression</i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fighting in matches will unlock points. These can be used to upgrade Yuki\u2019s stats and to unlock new skills that she can use in combat.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i>Free Battle</i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once the story has been completed Free Battle Mode will be unlocked where Yuki can keep testing her mettle in endless battles!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i>Achievements</i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game has its own achievements in the form of Titles. These Titles can be unlocked by reaching certain points in the story, or achieving certain milestones in the game.</p>",
